{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415041","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415041","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041504101:1":{"text":"你是难缠的对手，但你还不够格成为那万中无一。","source_cn":"你是难缠的对手，但你还不够格成为那万中无一。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B02E70D7FCA336","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041504102:1":{"text":"哼，死潮舰队的舰长，竟然想教我怎么做老大？","source_cn":"哼，死潮舰队的舰长，竟然想教我怎么做老大？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9240A0ED6CD0BFEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041504103:1":{"text":"真稀奇，我们好像不是朋友吧？","source_cn":"真稀奇，我们好像不是朋友吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A91B665107AD277","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041504104:1":{"text":"怎么，你不应该感谢我吗？泰西欧是被我抛弃的无用棋子，你把他踢出了棋盘。","source_cn":"怎么，你不应该感谢我吗？泰西欧是被我抛弃的无用棋子，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A0028CE64F5B59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041504105:1":{"text":"还有奈拉，如果不是我唤醒了海底的她……她到现在都和其他尸体一样沉在淤泥里。","source_cn":"还有奈拉，如果不是我唤醒了海底的她……她到现在都和其他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0F3B6D03A28CE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041504106:1":{"text":"抛弃了妹妹和父亲坐上这个位置的你，难道不应该感谢我吗？","source_cn":"抛弃了妹妹和父亲坐上这个位置的你，难道不应该感谢我吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E0A7FE5509F8DD8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041504107:1":{"text":"感谢我吧！索尼娅！","source_cn":"感谢我吧！索尼娅！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED2612F129DE65A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041504108:1":{"text":"你和我，也许才是同类，哈哈哈哈哈！","source_cn":"你和我，也许才是同类，哈哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25DA9866BE36C883","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041504109:1":{"text":"不……我和你不一样。","source_cn":"不……我和你不一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C8F37408D90242C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041504110:1":{"text":"你除了力量，一无所有。","source_cn":"你除了力量，一无所有。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEDC03957E85063C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041504111:1":{"text":"就连你的力量，也是你从别处窃取的。","source_cn":"就连你的力量，也是你从别处窃取的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1773A764162F6922","variant_status":"","male":"","fem