tle_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041504117:1":{"text":"哈哈哈哈哈，索尼娅，我还以为你是强者。","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈，索尼娅，我还以为你是强者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x242CB83865FD066A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041504118:1":{"text":"但瞧你对我说话的语气，你竟然在悲悯我？","source_cn":"但瞧你对我说话的语气，你竟然在悲悯我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x969CEA4B06D1CE45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041504119:1":{"text":"弱者竟敢悲悯强者？多可笑！","source_cn":"弱者竟敢悲悯强者？多可笑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DD9E20F75C7C774","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041504120:1":{"text":"要是我还在不死号上，你的头已经被我挂在船头了。","source_cn":"要是我还在不死号上，你的头已经被我挂在船头了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE6025F0B6D70C22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041504121:1":{"text":"你用死亡和折磨来恐吓别人，不就是因为你一直生活在这种恐惧中吗？","source_cn":"你用死亡和折磨来恐吓别人，不就是因为你一直生活在这种恐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B254EA935138807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041504122:1":{"text":"霍德希金，你不必在我面前自诩强者。你早就暴露了。","source_cn":"霍德希金，你不必在我面前自诩强者。你早就暴露了。","statu